      "message": "In general, you don\u0027t need to put the power signals in `named-gpios`. The power sequencing code doesn\u0027t need that, and other code shouldn\u0027t be able to touch them normally. The ones that have an `enum-name` might be an exception, if something else relies on the name. Try taking them out and then put back in the ones that you need to build.",
